{"4640350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "1101", "steam_appid": 4640350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640350/extras/2aea8fdfcb98bb8a492385c0f472454d.poster.avif?t=1776873242\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640350/extras/2aea8fdfcb98bb8a492385c0f472454d.webm?t=1776873242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640350/extras/2aea8fdfcb98bb8a492385c0f472454d.mp4?t=1776873242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World of Scale and Shadows</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1101 </strong>offers a vast, hyper-realistic frontier where the sky is just the beginning. Navigate a world built for both high-altitude freedom and claustrophobic intensity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Massive Open-World Biomes: Explore diverse alien landscapes—from jagged crystalline peaks to shifting neon deserts. Each biome is a seamless outdoor arena optimized for high-speed flight and long-range aerial dogfights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640350/extras/8e72a044c073f73ad76ee13e859daf6e.poster.avif?t=1776873242\" width=814 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640350/extras/8e72a044c073f73ad76ee13e859daf6e.webm?t=1776873242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640350/extras/8e72a044c073f73ad76ee13e859daf6e.mp4?t=1776873242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 Handcrafted Interior Missions: Dive into the depths of the frontier. When the mission moves indoors, your combat evolves. Engage in gritty, tactical CQC within industrial bunkers, ancient alien ruins, and high-tech labs designed for intense grounded combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamless Dual-Combat: Experience a &quot;Frictionless Engagement Engine.&quot; Switch from mach-speed aerial shooting to precise melee swordplay without loading screens, blending the scale of a flight sim with the impact of a hardcore ARPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical Survival: Face nine distinct alien races. Every encounter, whether in the open sky or a narrow corridor, requires unique strategies and high-fidelity combat logic. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640350/extras/346d62fb2f3cab61e1154b2ed69b468a.poster.avif?t=1776873242\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640350/extras/346d62fb2f3cab61e1154b2ed69b468a.webm?t=1776873242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640350/extras/346d62fb2f3cab61e1154b2ed69b468a.mp4?t=1776873242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Storyline</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The void of space offered no warning before the first volley struck. A human deep-space exploration team, deep into uncharted territory, was blindsided by a relentless, unknown force. Their vessel, once a marvel of engineering, was torn apart and pulled into the gravity well of a jagged, hostile planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amidst the smoking ruins of the crash site, the survivors—a mix of scarred human officers and advanced humanoid AI—found themselves stranded on a world that breathed fire and war. They weren't alone for long. Out of the haze emerged the Troczeid, a battle-hardened race fighting a desperate losing battle against a coalition of nine predatory civilizations: the Ghizeox, Dhugnaih, Shahnul, Ixaith, Uuzier, Hiraids, Crakroid, Ohears, and Vurqrots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having witnessed the raw efficiency of the human-AI coordination during the crash, the Troczeid saw a glimmer of hope. They offered the stranded crew a deal: an alliance in exchange for four powerful alien combat robots. With their own ship dead and the nine races closing in, the humans had no other choice but to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To lead the charge, the crew activated AI 1101, a humanoid AI with a tactical synth designed for peak combat logic. As the AI integrated into the alien tech, the Troczeid’s ancient warfare was reborn. A new strategy had begun, and the nine races were about to learn that some survivors are more dangerous than the ones who attacked them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640350/extras/a7be33684db25d29a0ab75e9d25be570.poster.avif?t=1776873242\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640350/extras/a7be33684db25d29a0ab75e9d25be570.webm?t=1776873242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4640350/extras/a7be33684db25d29a0ab75e9d25be570.mp4?t=1776873242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upcoming Content: Main Character AI 1101 and Giant Bosses coming in a future update.</strong></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com